    <status>Active</status>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>Day1</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>Hello {!get_lead_record.FirstName}, it&apos;s {!get_lead_record.Owner_First_Name__c}. I wanted to follow up on your interest in new homes available in the area. I want to get some more details about what you&apos;re looking for. Does today or tomorrow work for a 5-minute chat?</text>
    </textTemplates>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>Day2</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>{!get_lead_record.FirstName}, this is {!get_lead_record.Owner_First_Name__c}. You requested some information regarding new home construction in the area. Where are you in your current home search, and do you have a timeline for your move?</text>
    </textTemplates>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>Day3</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>Hey {!get_lead_record.FirstName}, it looks like you are busy, so perhaps I can get some info via text. I know you expressed interest in new homes. Do you have a specific area you are interested in or number of bedrooms you are looking for? I can then create a home list and send it for you to review. Thanks, and let me know, {!get_lead_record.Owner_First_Name__c}</text>
    </textTemplates>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>Day4</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>Hey {!get_lead_record.FirstName}, {!get_lead_record.Owner:User.Name} following up again, I reached out a couple of times. Do you still want information on the new construction or other homes in the area? Please let me know either way, {!get_lead_record.Owner_First_Name__c}</text>
    </textTemplates>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>Day5</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>Hey {!get_lead_record.FirstName}, we have a couple of new construction phases that are being released in the coming weeks. We are offering specials like no closing costs, and down payment assistance options. Let me know if you are interested in learning about these homes and if you qualify. Are you a first time home buyer or do you need to sell your home before buying a new property?</text>
    </textTemplates>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>Day6</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>Is there anything I can do to help you with your homebuying goals? I don&apos;t want to continue to follow up if your timing has changed or if your home search has paused. Just let me know if you are still interested in finding a new home or seeing what you can get approved for. {!get_lead_record.Owner_First_Name__c}</text>
    </textTemplates>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>GiftBox</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>{!get_lead_record.Realtor_Buying_Agent__r.FirstName}, Your pre-approval gift box has shipped to {!get_lead_record.Name}. We’re looking forward to another successful closing. Thank you for the referral!
Reach Home Loans
NMLS# 2266637
954-780-5565</text>
    </textTemplates>
